<view class="poker"><view class="title">德州扑克 · 无限注</view><view>盲注 10 / 20 · 起始 2000 · 仅游戏筹码</view><view class="settings"><picker range="{{counts}}" value="{{count}}" bindchange="count">AI 人数：{{counts[count]}}（重开生效）</picker><button size="mini" bindtap="reset">重新开桌</button></view><view class="seats"><view wx:for="{{players}}" wx:key="name" class="seat {{item.active?'active':''}}"><view>{{item.name}} · {{item.chips}}</view><view>{{item.action}} · 本轮 {{item.bet}}</view><view>{{item.cards}}</view></view></view><view class="felt"><view>底池 {{pot}}</view><view class="cards"><text wx:for="{{board}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</text></view><view>{{status}}</view></view><view class="cards"><text wx:for="{{hole}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</text></view><view class="actions"><button disabled="{{!human}}" data-type="fold" bindtap="act">弃牌</button><button disabled="{{!human}}" data-type="call" bindtap="act">{{call?'跟注 '+call:'过牌'}}</button><input type="number" value="{{amount}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="本轮加注至"/><button disabled="{{!human||!canRaise}}" data-type="raise" bindtap="act">加注至该金额</button><button disabled="{{!human||!canRaise}}" data-type="allin" bindtap="act">全押</button><button disabled="{{!canNext}}" bindtap="next">下一手</button></view><view class="rules">两张底牌与五张公共牌选最佳五张；四轮下注，支持边池和平分。AI 仅用公开信息模拟胜率，混合价值下注、诈唬和半诈唬。策略为启发式，尚无职业牌手强度认证。离开页面暂停，返回继续。</view><view wx:for="{{log}}" wx:key="index">{{item}}</view></view>
